{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-23","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与立方与比例","englishTitle":"If four numbers be in continued proportion, and the first be cube, the fourth will also be cube.","book":8,"number":23,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.23","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.23/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":23,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-23@raw-bc2d403311fd040b","contentId":"euclid-8-23","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc2d403311fd040b992bb512e90e7a5f75a4787807ed48aec79da700550afe0a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-23.statement","euclid-8-23.construction.1","euclid-8-23.proof.1","euclid-8-23.conclusion","euclid-8-23.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-23.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-23","revisionId":"euclid-8-23@raw-bc2d403311fd040b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c54f2d27f4c0610d5c18facf5face04f124c3c98e69e6a3b2bd28fce2240716a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If four numbers be in continued proportion, and the first be cube, the fourth will also be cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在连比例有四个数字,第一个数字是立方体,第四个数字也是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-23.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-23","revisionId":"euclid-8-23@raw-bc2d403311fd040b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cac2b41df4d9a16695f0415af32ff9f40aa3dd5429f90dfb3f2d5823dad7b2e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C, D be four numbers in continued proportion, and let A be cube; I say that D is also cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,C,D是连比例的4个数字,让A成为立方体;我说D也是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-23.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-23","revisionId":"euclid-8-23@raw-bc2d403311fd040b","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f876c54701a6ba474ffd46243954c4038652e0b7dd46a496d7c4f43a111c44be","citations":["euclid-8-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since between A, D there are two mean proportional numbers B, C, therefore A, D are similar solid numbers. [[VIII. 21](/principles/euclid-8-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,A到D间, 共有2 比例中项, B, C, 因此A, D,相似立体数。 [[VIII. 21](/principles/euclid-8-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-23.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-23","revisionId":"euclid-8-23@raw-bc2d403311fd040b","order":3,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3efc099fbfb60550c11aa4d8d88e8065f322a9ee1944ec72031e9d587b7df9a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A is cube; therefore D is also cube. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A是立方体, 因此D也是立方体 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-23.source","contentId":"euclid-8-23","revisionId":"euclid-8-23@raw-bc2d403311fd040b","order":4,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99347cbfff901160801696a2fde9b387d9ed97ac88e0d45e26b7dabe96f7f74e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en",